      // expected-warning@+1 {{SYCL kernel captured-closure layout differs between host and device (captured field 's': host: float at offset 4, device: int32 at offset 4); likely a #ifdef __SYCL_DEVICE_ONLY__ or divergent [=] capture -- undefined behavior [sycl-closure-layout-mismatch]}}
